    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "render_body_txt",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 470,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 510,
      "text": "Full-screen layout (line 529):\n\n• <div ref={mapContainer}>  — MapLibre mounts here\n\n• Controls panel (top-left):\n      – Title & branding\n      – Month slider (uses handleMonthChange)\n      – Heatmap variable buttons (temp / precip / sun)\n      – Heatmap color legend\n           → background uses stopsToGradient(STOP_MAP[v])\n      – Bubble metric <select> (resilience / cost / …)\n      – Bubble color legend\n           → background uses stopsToGradient(GREEN_RED_STOPS)\n      – 'Click a city bubble for details' empty-state hint\n\n• Hover tooltip (when hoverInfo != null):\n      – City variant: city name + country + metric value\n      – Grid variant: lat/lon + temp + precip + sunshine\n\n• <CityDetailPanel city={selectedCity}\n                    onClose={() => setSelectedCity(null)} />",
      "originalText": "Full-screen layout (line 529):\n\n• <div ref={mapContainer}>  — MapLibre mounts here\n\n• Controls panel (top-left):\n      – Title & branding\n      – Month slider (uses handleMonthChange)\n      – Heatmap variable buttons (temp / precip / sun)\n      – Heatmap color legend\n           → background uses stopsToGradient(STOP_MAP[v])\n      – Bubble metric <select> (resilience / cost / …)\n      – Bubble color legend\n           → background uses stopsToGradient(GREEN_RED_STOPS)\n      – 'Click a city bubble for details' empty-state hint\n\n• Hover tooltip (when hoverInfo != null):\n      – City variant: city name + country + metric value\n      – Grid variant: lat/lon + temp + precip + sunshine\n\n• <CityDetailPanel city={selectedCity}\n                    onClose={() => setSelectedCity(null)} />",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#064e3b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 160025,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 174709343,
      "isDeleted": false,
