      "x": 2620.0773809523807,
      "y": 2008.4107142857142,
      "width": 1300,
      "height": 90,
      "text": "Re-render trigger:  useEffect([climateData, variable, cities, bubbleMetric]) rebuilds both layers and calls overlay.setProps({ layers }).\nBubble range:  separate useEffect recomputes bubbleRange.current (min/max) whenever cities or bubbleMetric changes.\nCache:  cache.current is a useRef keyed by 'jan'…'dec' — once a month is loaded, switching back is instant.",
      "originalText": "Re-render trigger:  useEffect([climateData, variable, cities, bubbleMetric]) rebuilds both layers and calls overlay.setProps({ layers }).\nBubble range:  separate useEffect recomputes bubbleRange.current (min/max) whenever cities or bubbleMetric changes.\nCache:  cache.current is a useRef keyed by 'jan'…'dec' — once a month is loaded, switching back is instant.",
